				(size 3.81 3.81)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ed1e6d4e-284f-46b8-aace-1634799b0542")
	)
	(text_box "yellow = CAN High\ngreen = CAN Low\nred = LV Power (12-36 V)\nblack = LV Ground\n\nModules are powered via the main Low-Voltage bus (red and black) and communicate\nwith each other with CAN via the main CAN bus (green and yellow)\n\nEach module sheet contains the wiring and components specific to that circuit.\n\nTo add a new module:\n1.) Create a new hierarchical sheet (or copy an existing one) and label it appropriately \n2.) Implement module specific components and connections within sheet\n3.) Place VDD, GND, CANH, and CANL sheet pins and connect to main bus\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
